# Root .md files here are docs, not skills. pi treats direct .md children of a
# package root as skill candidates and warns "description is required" for each
# on every launch. pi, ripgrep, and fd all read .ignore, which would also hide
# these docs from ripgrep, so they are listed in .fdignore (read by pi and fd
# only).
